		"D-202 states the one feature description, and M3-E1's draw adapter builds on it. Depth of field is written against the description through the full-screen adapter in `tests/image/feature-effect.spec.ts`: the pass changes 45.5868% of the frame's pixels on WebGPU and 37.9149% on WebGL2, and the adapter keeps the feature out of the chain at Low, where its samples are 0, and places it at Medium, where they are 22, from its own answer and the run's held frame. `feature-effects.test.ts` holds the same gate without a GPU (8 of 8). The test does not ship and moves no built-in. The run behind those figures was made at `8905885bc`, the branch tip its own log names, with `bun run --cwd tests test feature-effect.spec.ts`.",
